## Third-party components / acknowledgements

### Code adapted from
- **`simeonpilgrim/nikon-firmware-tools`** (MIT) — the 3 XOR lookup
  tables and the container-format knowledge used in `analysis/nikon_decode.py`
  are derived from their `firmware decode/Firmware.cs` C# implementation.
  Original: https://github.com/simeonpilgrim/nikon-firmware-tools

### Used (but not modified) by CamRelay
- **gphoto2** (LGPL) — camera control library, called via CLI
- **rclone** (MIT) — sync tool, called via CLI
- **Flask** (BSD-3) — web UI
- **PyYAML** (MIT) — config parsing

### Findings about components inside the firmware (in `docs/hidden-features.md`)
These are observations, not redistributions. The firmware is
copyright Nikon; we only describe it.
- libpng 1.6.2 — PNG decoding
- zlib 1.2.8 — deflate/inflate
- FotoNation LibESB — red-eye removal, face detection
- Softune REALOS/ARM — Fujitsu Semiconductor RTOS
- T-Kernel 1.00.01 — sub-CPU RTOS
- Broadcom wl 7.45.244 — WiFi driver
- Murata BT/WiFi module firmware

The full firmware file `Z_30_0120.bin` is **not** included in this
repository. We analyse it statically, we do not redistribute it.
